  "description": "Liam Lucas returns as a war hero. Before leaving the Empire, he is promised wealth, fame, and the hand of the princess by the Emperor. He believed his miserable life as an Omega was over, and a bright future awaited him. However, a problem arose: Frederick, the Crown Prince of the Empire and his childhood friend, opposes the wedding.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
